# Geometric living-area rug (issue 166): a grid of brick diamonds with cream centres on mustard, a brick border with a thin walnut inner line, cream fringe at the short ends. Seen from above like the floor: flat, ink outline, palette only, no print or text. 8x4 tiles. Lies on the floor under the furniture and the player.
size: 128x64
